            <description><![CDATA[<h2>stash.mp3 1.0.7</h2>
<p><strong>Kit Studio is now stash.mp3.</strong> Same app, new name.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Rebranded throughout — window, menus, and onboarding now read <em>stash.mp3</em>.</li>
  <li>Your library folder moved from <code>~/KitStudio</code> to <code>~/stash.mp3</code> automatically on first launch. Nothing to do — all projects, samples, MIDI, and kits carry over.</li>
</ul>
<p><small>If you still see an old “Kit Studio” app in your Applications folder, you can drag it to the Trash.</small></p>
]]></description>
